---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
description: "Swing, salsa, country nights, and black-tie balls for young adults in DC, Maryland, and Virginia. Over 4,000 members. Find the next night out."
---
{%- set nxt = collections.upcoming[0] %}
<section class="hero on-dark">
  <img class="bg" src="/images/gallery/17.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1667" fetchpriority="high">
  <video class="bg" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/images/gallery/17.jpg" aria-hidden="true"><source src="/video/hero.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <h1>{{ home.hero.headline | replace(home.hero.emphasis, "<em>" + home.hero.emphasis + "</em>") | safe }}</h1>
      <p class="lede">{{ home.hero.lede }}</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn" href="/events/">{{ home.hero.primary }}</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/about/">{{ home.hero.secondary }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% if nxt %}
    <a class="next" href="{{ nxt.url }}">
      <img src="{{ nxt.data.image }}" alt="" width="1500" height="750">
      <div class="body">
        <p class="kicker">Next up · {{ nxt | iso | longDate }}</p>
        <h2>{{ nxt.data.title }}</h2>
        <p class="meta">{{ nxt.data.venue }} · {{ nxt.data.time }}{% if nxt.data.end %} to {{ nxt.data.end }}{% endif %}</p>
        <span class="btn">Get tickets</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band navy on-dark logos-band" id="featured">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ press.logosHeading }}</p>
    <ul class="logos">
    {%- for l in press.logos %}
      <li>{% if l.url %}<a href="{{ l.url }}" rel="noopener">{% endif %}{% if l.logo %}<img src="{{ l.logo }}" alt="{{ l.name }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}{{ l.name }}{% endif %}{% if l.url %}</a>{% endif %}</li>
    {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band navy on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>On the calendar</h2><a href="/events/">All events</a></div>
    <ul class="events">
    {%- for e in collections.upcoming %}
      <li><a href="{{ e.url }}">
        <span class="date">{{ e | iso | shortDate }}<small>{{ e | iso | weekday }} · {{ e.data.time }}</small></span>
        <img class="thumb" src="{{ e.data.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="1500" height="750">
        <span><h3>{{ e.data.title }}</h3><p class="venue">{{ e.data.venue }}</p></span>
      </a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">These sell out. New dates drop on <a href="{{ site.instagram }}" style="color:var(--amber)">Instagram</a> first. <a href="#signup" style="color:var(--amber)">Join the list</a> to get them by email.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>Four nights we run back all year</h2></div>
    <div class="series">
      <article><img src="/images/gallery/12.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div class="txt"><h3>All-American Country Nights</h3><p>Country swing, two-step, line dancing, BBQ, and wine, in the barn at Whiffletree Farm in Warrenton or on the grounds at Bull Run. A 45-minute lesson opens every night, so everyone starts out on the floor together.</p></div></article>
      <article><img src="/images/gallery/03.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div class="txt"><h3>Sangria y Salsa</h3><p>The DMV's largest Latin dance series. Salsa and bachata, live Latin music, sangria, and the whole vineyard at The Winery at Bull Run.</p></div></article>
      <article><img src="/images/gallery/13.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div class="txt"><h3>Galas, holidays, and special nights</h3><p>Black tie, a live big band, and a few hundred people who dressed for it. The Crooner Christmas Ball at Hotel Heron, St. Joseph's Ball at Catholic University, and The Grape Gatsby at Old Farm Winery. Holiday nights and the one-off events we run once and never the same way twice belong here too.</p></div></article>
      <article><img src="/images/gallery/23.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div class="txt"><h3>Soirees and summer nights</h3><p>Strawberries on the lawn at President Lincoln's Cottage, live jazz in a hotel courtyard in Old Town Alexandria, disco on the docks at Columbia Island Marina.</p></div></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band navy on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>This is what Whiffletree Farm looks like at 9 pm</h2><a href="/about/#watch">More videos</a></div>
    <video class="feature" controls preload="none" poster="/video/swing.jpg" width="1280" height="720"><source src="/video/swing.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <p style="margin-top:.8rem;font-size:.95rem">Swing into Spring at Whiffletree Farm, April 2025. Video by Josh Levitas.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band paper">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <img src="/images/gallery/09.jpg" alt="Hundreds of guests at a DSC ball" loading="lazy" width="2500" height="1668">
    <div>
      <h2>{{ home.story.heading }}</h2>
      <p class="lede">{{ home.story.lede }}</p>
      <p>{{ home.story.body }}</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/about/">Read our story</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>{{ press.homeHeading }}</h2><a href="/press/">{{ press.homeLink }}</a></div>
    <ul class="news three">
    {%- for a in press.items %}{% if loop.index0 < 3 %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ a.url }}" rel="noopener"{% if a.image %} class="withpic"{% endif %}>
          {% if a.image %}<img src="{{ a.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
          <div>
          <p class="pub">{{ a.publication }}{% if a.date %} · {{ a.date | fullDate }}{% endif %}</p>
          <h3>{{ a.title }}</h3>
          <span class="read">Read the article</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </li>
    {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band navy on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>From the dance floor</h2><a href="/gallery/">All photos</a></div>
    <div class="mosaic">
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/gallery/04.jpg" alt="A packed dance floor at The Winery at Bull Run" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/gallery/07.jpg" alt="Guests in 1920s dress" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/gallery/21.jpg" alt="Friends at a ball" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/gallery/14.jpg" alt="A dance under stage fog" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/gallery/11.jpg" alt="Country dancing" loading="lazy"></a>
    </div>
    <div class="quotes">
    {%- for q in quotes.items %}
      <blockquote>
        <p>“{{ q.quote }}”</p>
        <cite>{{ q.who }}{% if q.role %}, {{ q.role }}{% endif %}{% if q.source %}, in {% if q.url %}<a href="{{ q.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ q.source }}</a>{% else %}{{ q.source }}{% endif %}{% endif %}</cite>
      </blockquote>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>Our brand ambassadors</h2><a href="/team/">Meet the whole team</a></div>
    <div class="ambassadors">
      {%- for m in team %}{% if m.role == "Brand Ambassador" %}
      <a class="amb" href="/team/">
        <img src="{{ m.photo }}" alt="{{ m.name }}" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy">
        <div><h3>{{ m.name }}</h3><p class="role">Brand Ambassador</p><p>{{ m.bio | truncate(160) }}</p></div>
      </a>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      <div class="amb join">
        <div><h3>Ambassadors started as regulars.</h3><p>They represent DSC at events and online, welcome the people who came alone, and help set the tone of the room. We add a few a year.</p><a class="btn" href="/brand-ambassador/">Become an ambassador</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band dusk-merch">
  <div class="wrap merch">
    <div>
      <h2>Wear the collective.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Tees, hats, and hoodies with the DSC mark. Printed to order, shipped to you.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="{{ site.merch }}">Shop the merch</a>
    </div>
    <img src="/images/gallery/08.jpg" alt="DSC regulars at a country night" loading="lazy" width="2500" height="1667">
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band navy on-dark venues-band" id="venues">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>{{ venues.heading }}</h2></div>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:-1rem">{{ venues.lede }}</p>
    <ul class="venues">
    {%- for v in venues.items %}
      <li>{% if v.url %}<a href="{{ v.url }}" rel="noopener">{% endif %}{% if v.logo %}<img src="{{ v.logo }}" alt="{{ v.name }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}{{ v.name }}{% endif %}{% if v.url %}</a>{% endif %}</li>
    {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="signup">
  <div class="wrap signup">
    <div>
      <h2>Get the date before it sells out.</h2>
      <p>One email when a night is announced, one when early bird pricing is about to end. That's it.</p>
    </div>
    <form action="https://formsubmit.co/{{ site.email }}" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New mailing list signup from the website">
      <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="{{ site.url }}/thanks/">
      <input type="text" name="first" placeholder="First name" required aria-label="First name">
      <input type="text" name="last" placeholder="Last name" aria-label="Last name">
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email address" required aria-label="Email address">
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Sign me up</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
